                "text": "Duquesne is a pillar in Pennsylvania\u2019s higher education system. I enjoyed a visit this morning with @Duqedu President Gormley, Dean Kauffman, and Joe Rockey. We toured the College of Medicine to see the innovative ways technology is being used to advance healthcare at this teaching hospital.",
