                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Many people might be unaware that the mushroom capital of the world is Kennett Square, Pennsylvania, employing nearly 10,000 people and contributing nearly $1.3 billion to the local economy. @USDA\u2019s crop insurance program should be available to all farmers, and I\u2019m hopeful that this yearlong study yields much needed coverage to protect Pennsylvania\u2019s mushroom farmers. I look forward to working on this and other agriculture initiatives with my PA colleagues in the House and the Senate.",
