                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Students in career and technical schools across the Commonwealth are studying to join the next generation of PA\u2019s workforce, and Upper Bucks County Technical School (UBCTS) is one of the leaders in this space. UBCTS offers programs in manufacturing, healthcare, IT, law enforcement, and emergency services to over 900 students in the southeast region. My team toured UBCTS\u2019s facility in Perkasie, PA, to learn more about the institution\u2019s growth, industry partnerships, and their commitment to preparing students for in-demand careers.",
