                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Had a great meeting with Erie Insurance leadership to discuss their redevelopment projects and to commemorate their 100th anniversary, which they celebrated just this past weekend. Erie Insurance is the largest employer in the county, and I look forward to collaborating with them to address key issues like housing affordability, workforce development, and insurance regulations.",
