                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Ryan Aument, our State Director, was proud to represent our office at the Harrisburg Regional Chamber\u2019s Policy Pulse Speaker Series this month. He shared our key priorities and engaged with business, nonprofit, healthcare, education, and government leaders from across the Harrisburg region. I remain committed to supporting policies that strengthen PA\u2019s business community and create opportunities for growth. Thank you to the Chamber for hosting this important conversation.",
