                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Some constituents have been asking about Medicaid cuts. Most Americans want to cut waste, fraud, & abuse within the program while preserving benefits for the vulnerable individuals it's intended to help. I spoke about this issue earlier this week with @DawnStensland. Listen \u2b07\ufe0f",
