                "retweet_count": 17,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "To be clear: I don\u2019t support removing Medicaid benefits from the vulnerable people they are intended to help. But, I do back the President\u2019s push to restore fiscal sanity and cut down on the waste, fraud, and abuse that\u2019s gotten out-of-control over the past four years. https://t.co/QkrVNJAC6B",
