                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I fully agree with @POTUS \u2014 we should not cut Medicaid benefits. At the same time, I've always supported rooting out waste, fraud, and abuse, but never at the expense of those in need of the benefits. Listen to how I explained my position on this important issue on my recent telephone townhall:",
