                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Our nurses and healthcare workers are incredibly important to our Commonwealth. Last week, my team and I met with advocates from the American Organization for Nursing Leadership on how we can encourage nursing education and support our robust medical industry in Pennsylvania. https://t.co/tx347cJWrl",
