                "reply_count": 12,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Had a productive meeting with Pike County leaders yesterday \u2013 including my friend Bill Rosado, Warden Craig Lowe, and County Commissioners Matt Osterberg and Ronald R. Schmalzle.\n\nWe discussed my continued support for rural healthcare, the impacts of a government shutdown, and ensuring Pike County \u2013 the fastest-growing county in PA \u2013 has the resources it needs to thrive.\n\nWe are working together to keep Pike County a great place to live, work, and raise a family.",
