                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I recently visited the Wyoming County Healthcare Center in Tunkhannock along with @SenLisaBaker, the Wyoming County Commissioners, and some great community leaders including my friend, Wyoming County District Attorney, Joe Peters. The progress toward restoring this facility is incredible. Rural communities deserve reliable, local care, and I\u2019m committed to supporting this facility with the resources they need to keep healthcare accessible and affordable so no one has to travel long distances for medical care.",
